00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,500
Well, then, I might as well offer to stay.
好吧，那麼，我不妨提出留下來。

178
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,500
Hey, does anybody else feel bad about Ross?
嘿，還有人對羅斯感到難過嗎？

179
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,440
Why, do you think he's still mad at us?
為什麼，你認為他還在生我們的氣嗎？

180
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:06,020
Well, he's probably more mad since you called him this morning to borrow his goggles.
好吧，自從你今天早上打電話給他借護目鏡後，他可能更生氣了。

181
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,580
Mine aren't tinted.
我的沒有染色。

182
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:12,580
Chandler!
錢德勒！

183
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:13,720
What?
什麼？

184
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,780
What does the sign say?
標誌上寫著什麼？

185
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,380
Beam me up, Jesus.
耶穌，請照亮我。

186
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,880
No, the no smoking sign.
不，禁止吸煙標誌。

187
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,660
There's no smoking in my grandmother's cab.
我祖母的計程車裡禁止吸煙。

188
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:29,100
Okay, well, then I have to go to the bathroom.
好吧，那我得去趟洗手間了。

189
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,700
Oh, please, Chandler.
哦，拜託，錢德勒。

190
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,480
No, no one's schedule stops.
不，沒有人的日程安排會停止。

191
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,120
You can go when we stop for gas.
等我們停下來加油時你就可以走了。

192
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:35,240
Okay, come on.
好吧，來吧。

193
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,400
There's a rest stop right up there.
上面有休息站。

194
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:36,880
Come on.
快點。

195
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:37,880
I really have to go.
我真的得走了。

196
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,380
Oh.
哦。

197
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,840
Well, now I have to go.
好吧，現在我得走了。

198
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,840
Is that all that it takes?
這就是所需要的一切嗎？

199
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,940
Sometimes it's just a small breeze.
有時只是一陣微風。

200
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:57,420
Here we go.
開始了。

201
00:08:58,300 --> 00:08:59,000
Okay, brace yourself.
好吧，做好準備吧。

202
00:08:59,100 --> 00:08:59,340
What?
什麼？

203
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,820
Okay, out.
好的，出去。

204
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,400
Where are you going to go?
你要去哪裡？

205
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,700
No, thank you.
不，謝謝。

206
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:13,820
No, Rachel, never pees in public restrooms.
不，雷切爾，從不在公共廁所裡撒尿。

207
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:20,220
Well, they never have any paper in there, you know, so my rule is no tissue, no tushy.
嗯，他們裡面從來沒有任何紙，你知道，所以我的規則是沒有紙巾，沒有紙巾。

208
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:28,200
Well, if everybody's going...
好吧，如果大家都去的話...

209
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,560
Oh, you know what, don't close it.
哦，你知道嗎，不要關閉它。

210
00:09:31,620 --> 00:09:32,680
The keys are in there.
鑰匙就在那裡。

211
00:09:32,940 --> 00:09:34,060
Oh, no, no, no, no.
哦，不，不，不，不。

212
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:35,480
What's going on?
這是怎麼回事？

213
00:09:35,980 --> 00:09:36,820
My lighter's in there.
我的打火機在裡面。

214
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:47,540
Damn, the tailpipe's not hot enough to light this.
該死，排氣管還不夠熱，無法點燃它。

215
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:50,180
Relax, okay?
放鬆點，好嗎？

216
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,140
I can get this open.
我可以開啟這個。

217
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,200
Anybody got a coat hanger?
有人有衣架嗎？

218
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:52,920
Oh, I do.
哦，我願意。

219
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,580
Oh, no, wait a minute.
哦，不，等一下。

220
00:09:54,700 --> 00:09:56,680
I took it out of my shirt when I put it on this morning.
今天早上我穿上襯衫時，我把它從襯衫裡拿出來了。

221
00:09:58,780 --> 00:10:03,040
So if your parents hadn't got divorced, you'd be able to answer a question like a normal person?
那麼如果你的父母沒有離婚，你能像正常人一樣回答問題嗎？

222
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:08,880
Look, I just need a wire something to jimmy it.
聽著，我只需要一根電線來固定它。

223
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:11,580
Oh, hey, one of you guys give me the underwire from your bra.
哦，嘿，你們中的一個人把你胸罩上的鋼圈給我。

224
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:12,380
What?
什麼？

225
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:12,860
What?
什麼？

226
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:15,360
Come on, who has the biggest boobs?
來來來，誰的胸部最大？

227
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,020
Wait, what?
等等，什麼？

228
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:21,080
Whoever has the biggest boobs has the biggest bra, therefore has the biggest wire.
誰擁有最大的胸部，誰就有最大的胸罩，因此擁有最大的鋼絲。

229
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,160
No, mine are too expensive.
不行，我的太貴了。

230
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:27,460
If you want to get back in the car, we need that wire.
如果你想回到車裡，我們需要那根電線。

231
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,040
Your call.
你的電話。

232
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:33,940
Okay, Monica's are the biggest.
好吧，莫妮卡的是最大的。

233
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,680
These tiny little non-pressed?
這些小小不壓？

234
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:40,380
Please, it's got to be Rachel.
拜託，一定是雷切爾。

235
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:43,760
Well, no, no, no, mine are deceptively small.
嗯，不，不，不，我的很小。

236
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:47,380
I mean, I actually sometimes stuff my bra.
我的意思是，我有時會塞滿我的胸罩。

237
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:50,680
All right, well, then your bra would still be big.
好吧，那你的胸罩還是大的。

238
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:54,380
No, I stuff outside the bra.
不，我把東西塞在胸罩外面。

239
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,860
Ladies, let's just compromise, okay?
女士們，我們妥協一下，好嗎？

240
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:00,340
Phoebe, Rachel, take off Monica's bra.
菲比，瑞秋，脫掉莫妮卡的胸罩。

241
00:11:01,300 --> 00:11:02,620
All right, forget it.
好吧，忘了吧。

242
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:03,400
Never mind.
沒關係。

243
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,180
You have mine.
你有我的。

244
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,080
Thank you.
謝謝。

245
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,060
Chandler, what are you doing?
錢德勒，你在做什麼？

246
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:11,140
There is a trash can right there.
那裡有一個垃圾桶。

247
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:15,100
Well, I thought if I littered, that crying Indian might come by and save us.
好吧，我想如果我亂丟垃圾，那個哭泣的印地安人可能會來救我們。

248
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:19,780
Okay, there.
好的，就在那裡。

249
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:23,840
Thank you, Phoebe, that is very generous.
謝謝你，菲比，你真是太慷慨了。

250
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:27,820
Wow, this is nice.
哇，這很好。

251
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:31,060
Were you planning on meeting somebody up there?
你打算去那裡見某人嗎？

252
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:34,240
Okay, now let's decide who has the nicest ass.
好吧，現在我們來決定誰的屁股最好看。

253
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:39,100
And there you go.
就這樣吧。

254
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:44,960
Chandler.
錢德勒。

255
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:47,580
At least let me smoke it to the good part.
至少讓我把它抽到好的部分。

256
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,360
Okay.
好的。

257
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,560
Oh, no.
哦，不。

258
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:01,440
What?
什麼？

259
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:02,840
What's going on?
這是怎麼回事？

260
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,700
Yeah, this has happened before.
是的，這種事以前發生過。

261
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,060
So you know how to fix it?
那你知道如何解決它嗎？

262
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:09,020
Yep, put more gas in.
是的，加點油。

263
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,980
Hi, what are you doing here?
嗨，你在這裡做什麼？

264
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:29,480
Oh, I was just wondering, when you and I split up, did you get the tape that was half the last episode of MASH and half the hostages coming home?
哦，我只是想知道，當你和我分手時，你拿到了《MASH》最後一集一半和人質回家的一半的磁帶嗎？

265
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:34,780
Uh, yeah, but now it's Susan and me in Mexico and the hostages coming home.
呃，是的，但現在我和蘇珊在墨西哥，人質也回家了。

266
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:36,340
Where's Ben?
本在哪裡？

267
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,340
He's sleeping.
他正在睡覺。

268
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:37,680
Oh.
哦。

269
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,760
Is this a bad time?
這是一個糟糕的時期嗎？

270
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:46,300
Yeah, actually, Susan's going to be here any minute. It's kind of an anniversary.
是的，事實上，蘇珊隨時都會來。這有點像週年紀念日。

271
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:49,680
Oh, I thought you guys got married in January.
哦，我以為你們一月就結婚了。

272
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:51,780
Different kind of anniversary.
不一樣的週年紀念日。

273
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:52,480
Oh.
哦。

274
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:54,820
Oh.
哦。

275
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,380
So, anyway.
所以，無論如何。

276
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:02,620
Candles, champagne, anniversaries are great.
蠟燭、香檳、週年紀念都很棒。

277
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,380
Because, you know, love lasts forever, you know.
因為，你知道，愛是永恆的，你知道。

278
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:10,180
Nothing like it in this lifetime, money in the bank.
這輩子沒有比這更好的了，銀行裡的錢。

279
00:13:10,700 --> 00:13:11,920
So Rachel and I broke up.
於是我和雷切爾分手了。

280
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:15,700
God, Ross, I am so sorry.
天哪，羅斯，我很抱歉。

281
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:16,640
Yeah.
是的。

282
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:23,640
You know what? I want to talk to you about this so much, but we should probably do it when we can really get into it.
你知道嗎？我很想和你討論這個問題，但我們應該在我們真正能夠深入的時候再討論。

283
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:25,280
You free for dinner tomorrow night?
明天晚上有空吃晚餐嗎？

284
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:26,420
Oh, yeah, I'd love that.
哦，是的，我很樂意。

285
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,160
Me too.
我也是。

286
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:30,480
I guess it all started when Rachel got this new job.
我想這一切都是從雷切爾得到這份新工作開始的。

287
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,680
Okay, yeah, AAA can pick us up.
好的，是的，AAA 可以來接我們。

288
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:36,320
Yeah.
是的。

289
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:37,480
Just what town are we near?
我們靠近哪個城鎮？

290
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:39,140
Fremont.
弗裡蒙特。

291
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:40,460
Westmont.
韋斯特蒙特。

292
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:41,800
Westburg?
韋斯特堡？

293
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:43,220
Why aren't you answering?
為什麼不回答？

294
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,920
Do you know at least what route we're on?
你至少知道我們走哪條路嗎？

295
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,440
We are definitely on Route 27.
我們肯定是在27號公路。

296
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:52,360
Okay, we are at a rest stop on Route 27.
好的，我們已經到了 27 號公路的休息站了。

297
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,860
Okay, there is no Route 27.
好吧，沒有27號公路。

298
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:57,660
Okay, either 93 or 76.
好吧，要嘛93，要嘛76。

299
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,380
I don't know.
我不知道。

300
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:01,040
I'm sorry, I always slipped in the back when we drove up here.
抱歉，我們開車來這裡的時候我總是在後座滑倒。

301
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:06,380
Okay, hey, can you just send someone up and down 76 and just check every rest stop?
好吧，嘿，你能派人上下 76 並檢查每個休息站嗎？

302
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,760
And, and also 93.
還有，還有93。

303
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:10,760
Okay.
好的。

304
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:12,940
Yeah, no, they don't do that.
是的，不，他們不這樣做。

305
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,080
Ugh.
啊。

306
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:18,480
Okay, well, somebody will come and save us.
好吧，會有人來救我們的。

307
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,080
Who?
WHO？

308
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:21,740
I mean, have you seen a car come by here in the last hour and a half?
我的意思是，在過去的一個半小時裡你有看到一輛車經過這裡嗎？

309
00:14:22,340 --> 00:14:23,380
I think we should call Ross.
我想我們應該打電話給羅斯。

310
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,660
Maybe he can get a car to pick us up.
也許他可以派輛車來接我們。

311
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:28,020
No, no, I am not getting in a car with Ross.
不，不，我不會和羅斯一起上車。

312
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,940
We will just have to live here.
我們只需要住在這裡。

313
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:35,380
No, you guys, I'm not getting in a car with him.
不，你們，我不會跟他一起上車。

314
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,680
You'll have to think of something else.
你必須想點別的事。

315
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,020
Oh, good.
哦，很好。

316
00:14:38,100 --> 00:14:39,380
Oh, Joey and Chandler are back.
哦，喬伊和錢德勒回來了。

317
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,140
So the going for help went well.
所以尋求幫助的過程很順利。

318
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:45,100
Yeah, yeah.
是啊是啊。

319
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:48,680
Smokey Joe here got halfway to the highway and collapsed.
斯莫基·喬（Smokey Joe）開到高速公路的一半時就倒下了。

320
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:51,460
I have the lung capacity of a two-year-old.
我的肺活量相當於兩歲孩子的肺活量。

321
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,720
Then why are you smoking?
那你為什麼還要抽煙呢？

322
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,480
Well, it's very unsettling.
嗯，這非常令人不安。

323
00:14:59,100 --> 00:14:59,540
Right?
正確的？

324
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:00,060
Right?
正確的？

325
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,960
I mean, it's pretty unbelievable, you know?
我的意思是，這太令人難以置信了，你知道嗎？

326
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:05,180
I mean, they just took off, took off without even looking back.
我的意思是，他們就起飛了，起飛了，甚至沒有回頭。

327
00:15:06,180 --> 00:15:07,980
You know, I don't, I don't need them.
你知道，我不需要，我不需要它們。

328
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:10,100
I've got you guys now as friends.
我現在已經把你們當朋友了。

329
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:10,780
You and Susan.
你和蘇珊。

330
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,280
Ah, Susan will be so pleased.
啊，蘇珊一定會很高興的。

331
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:16,900
717?
717？

332
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:18,680
Where's 717?
717在哪裡？

333
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:23,700
Hey, you have more of these for Susan, right?
嘿，你還有更多這些給蘇珊，對吧？

334
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:25,740
No, but that's okay.
不，但沒關係。

335
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:27,960
I'll just put out pickles or something.
我就放泡菜什麼的。

336
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:33,900
Ross, thank God.
羅斯，感謝上帝。

337
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:34,780
Pheebs?
菲比斯？

338
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:36,240
Why, why are you whispering?
為什麼，為什麼你在竊竊私語？

339
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,380
I ate a bug.
我吃了一隻蟲。

340
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:40,800
Hey, Rach.
嘿，瑞秋。

341
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,780
The tampons here are only a penny.
這裡的衛生棉條只要一分錢。

342
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,020
Let's stock up.
我們去囤貨吧

343
00:15:45,860 --> 00:15:46,720
Listen, Ross.
聽著，羅斯。

344
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:47,880
We ran out of gas.
我們的汽油用完了。

345
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:48,660
And we don't have any gas.
而且我們沒有任何天然氣。

346
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:50,360
I don't know where we are, so we can't get a tow truck.
我不知道我們在哪裡，所以我們找不到拖車。

347
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,060
Oh.
哦。

348
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,740
Now you want a favor.
現在你想要一個忙。

349
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,080
Yes, please.
是的，請。

350
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:57,180
Well, uh, I'm sorry your car broke down, Pheebs.
好吧，呃，我很抱歉你的車壞了，菲比。

351
00:15:57,240 --> 00:16:00,520
But I'm a little too busy with some of my real friends right now.
但我現在和一些真正的朋友在一起有點太忙了。

352
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:03,400
But please call to let me know you got home safely, okay?
但請打電話告訴我你已經安全到家了，好嗎？

353
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,540
Phoebe, hang on a second.
菲比，等一下。

354
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,000
Here, take my car.
來，開我的車。

355
00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:07,720
Go pick up your friends.
去接你的朋友吧。

356
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:09,040
No, I'm not going to pick them up.
不，我不會去接他們。

357
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:12,320
Listen, we both know you're going to do it because you're not a jerk.
聽著，我們都知道你會這麼做，因為你不是個混蛋。

358
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:12,760
Okay?
好的？

359
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:15,860
So you can either sulk here for half an hour and then go pick them up.
所以你要麼在這裡生悶氣半小時，然後去接他們。

360
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:18,260
Or you can save us both time and sulk in the car.
或者你可以節省我們兩個的時間，也可以在車上生悶氣。

361
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:19,200
No, Rachel doesn't want me to...
不，雷切爾不想讓我...

362
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:22,560
Look, I am sorry that Rachel dumped you because she fell in love with that Mark guy.
聽著，我很抱歉瑞秋拋棄了你，因為她愛上了那個馬克傢伙。

363
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:24,380
And you are the innocent victim in all of this.
而你是這一切的無辜受害者。

364
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,800
But don't punish your friends for what Rachel did to you.
但不要因為雷切爾對你所做的事情而懲罰你的朋友。

365
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,220
Yeah, you're right.
是的，你是對的。

366
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,280
Phoebe, hang on a second.
菲比，等一下。

367
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,240
Ross wants to tell you something.
羅斯想告訴你一件事。

368
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:34,540
What?
什麼？

369
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:36,800
You slept with someone else?
你和別人睡過嗎？

370
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:41,380
We were on a break, okay?
我們當時正在休息，好嗎？

371
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,180
We were, we were...
我們曾經、我們曾經...

372
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:43,560
Yeah.
是的。

373
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:44,900
Where are you?
你在哪裡？

374
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,820
I'll find you.
我會找到你的。

375
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,240
You slept with another woman?
你和別的女人睡過？

376
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:51,440
Oh, you're one to talk.
哦，你是一個會說話的人。

377
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,240
Okay, done.
好的，完成了。

378
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,120
What's plat?
什麼是平板？

379
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:06,980
That's help spelled backwards so that the helicopters can read it from the air.
這是倒著拼字的幫助，以便直升機可以從空中讀取它。

380
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:09,720
Huh.
呵呵。

381
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:11,700
What's doofus spelled backwards?
doofus 倒過來拼成什麼？

382
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,680
Oh, oh, car!
哦哦，車！

383
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:16,280
Car!
車！

384
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,140
Ugh!
啊!

385
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,820
It's Ross on one of his drives!
這是羅斯在他的一次突破中！

386
00:17:22,460 --> 00:17:22,920
Hey!
嘿！

387
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:26,120
What is he doing here?
他在這裡做什麼？

388
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,220
He is saving your butt.
他正在拯救你的屁股。

389
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:33,040
Unless, of course, I'm stepping on some toes here, in which case I can just mosey on.
當然，除非我在這裡踩到了一些腳趾，在這種情況下我可以繼續前進。

390
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:35,520
I've got plenty of people to help on the interstate.
我有很多人可以在州際公路上提供幫助。

391
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:37,680
Please give me your help, please.
請給我你的幫助。

392
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:38,320
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

393
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:38,700
Give me your help.
給我你的幫助。

394
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:39,340
Fine.
美好的。

395
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,220
Hey, hey, hey.
嘿，嘿，嘿。

396
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:42,600
Oh!
哦！

397
00:17:44,300 --> 00:17:45,180
Oh, no.
哦，不。

398
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,800
Now it's not going to make any sense.
現在它沒有任何意義了。

399
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:50,300
You guys.
你們。

400
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,880
What do we do about Ross?
我們該怎麼辦羅斯？

401
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,120
He drove all the way up here.
他一路開車來到這裡。

402
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:54,580
What do we do?
我們該怎麼辦？

403
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,580
Just, like, send him back and then we're going to go skiing?
就像，送他回來然後我們就去滑雪？

404
00:17:56,840 --> 00:17:57,900
Oh, this is horrible.
哦，這太可怕了。

405
00:17:58,060 --> 00:17:58,880
It's just horrible.
這太可怕了。

406
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:02,760
Hey, you guys, you think we should ask Ross to come along?
嘿，你們覺得我們應該請羅斯一起來嗎？

407
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:04,220
I know, but what about Rachel?
我知道，但是雷切爾呢？

408
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:05,800
I mean, how are we going to even ask her?
我的意思是，我們要怎麼去問她呢？

409
00:18:06,420 --> 00:18:07,200
Ask me what?
問我什麼？

410
00:18:10,340 --> 00:18:13,300
Um, if, uh, it might be okay if Ross came skiing?
嗯，如果，呃，羅斯來滑雪也許可以嗎？

411
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:14,960
No, I wasn't going to ask.
不，我不想問。

412
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,720
Yeah, I wasn't going to ask.
是的，我本來不想問的。

413
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:18,160
Okay.
好的。

414
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:19,940
You guys are unbelievable.
你們真是令人難以置信。

415
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:21,500
No, he cannot come.
不，他不能來。

416
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:22,460
Excuse me?
打擾一下？

417
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:23,140
It's horrible.
太可怕了。

418
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:28,040
Oh, please, can't I come to your special, magical cabin?
哦，拜託，我不能來你那間特別的神奇小屋嗎？

419
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,480
Why would you even want to come, Ross?
羅斯，你為什麼想來？

420
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:32,660
You're a horrible skier.
你是個糟糕的滑雪者。

421
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:35,740
Oh, hitting me where it hurts, my ski skills.
哦，我的滑雪技術擊中了我的痛處。

422
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,560
Here we go again.
又來了。

423
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,440
I can't handle this, you guys.
我無法處理這個，你們。

424
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:41,300
You know, I can handle it.
你知道，我能應付。

425
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:42,440
It handles my middle name.
它處理我的中間名。

426
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:45,620
Actually, it's the, uh, the middle part of my first name.
事實上，這是，呃，我名字的中間部分。

427
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:50,380
All right, Pheebs, the cab's ready.
好吧，菲比，計程車準備好了。

428
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:51,480
All right, let's go.
好吧，我們走吧。

429
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,160
You're welcome.
不客氣。

430
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:56,220
Oh, I'm sorry, were you speaking to me or sleeping with someone else?
哦，對不起，你是在跟我說話還是跟別人睡？

431
00:18:58,540 --> 00:18:59,840
We were on a break.
我們當時正在休息。

432
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:03,280
You know, Ross, why don't you just put that on your answering machine?
你知道嗎，羅斯，為什麼不把它放到你的答錄機上呢？

433
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:04,700
Hey, hey, it's valid, okay?
嘿嘿，這是有效的，好嗎？

434
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:06,340
And I'm not the only one who thinks so.
而且我並不是唯一一個這麼想的人。

435
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:08,020
Monica agrees with me.
莫妮卡同意我的觀點。

436
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:09,300
What?
什麼？

437
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,700
I don't know.
我不知道。

438
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,820
That's what you said last night.
這就是你昨晚說的話。

439
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:17,760
What I said was, was that I understood.
我說的是，我明白了。

440
00:19:19,020 --> 00:19:20,500
Joey is the one who agreed with you.
喬伊是同意你觀點的人。

441
00:19:20,860 --> 00:19:21,320
Okay.
好的。

442
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:22,920
Really, Joey?
真的嗎，喬伊？

443
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:25,480
What?
什麼？

444
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:27,820
You know what?
你知道嗎？

445
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:30,220
There is no right or wrong here.
這裡沒有對錯。

446
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:33,100
No, I think it's very obvious who's wrong here.
不，我認為誰錯了是很明顯的。

447
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,440
Obviously not to Joey.
顯然不是喬伊。

448
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:38,360
What?
什麼？

449
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:42,560
Wait, but Joey and Monica do the same thing that I do.
等等，但喬伊和莫妮卡做了和我一樣的事。

450
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:44,660
No, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不。

451
00:19:44,660 --> 00:19:45,820
Guess where I am!
猜猜我在哪裡！

452
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:55,840
Hey, hey, hey, hey!
嘿嘿嘿嘿！

453
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:58,620
Look what you're doing to Chandler!
看看你對錢德勒做了什麼！

454
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:06,940
Yeah, look, we know that this is really, really hard for you guys, okay?
是的，聽著，我們知道這對你們來說真的真的很難，好嗎？

455
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:10,400
You don't, all right, you don't have to love each other, okay?
你不需要，好吧，你們不必彼此相愛，好嗎？

456
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:13,180
You don't even, you don't even have to like each other much right now.
你甚至不需要，你現在甚至不必非常喜歡對方。

457
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:17,040
But, please, you have to figure out a way to be around each other.
但是，拜託，你們必須找到一種方式來相處。

458
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,720
Yeah, and not put us in the middle.
是的，不要把我們夾在中間。

459
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:22,600
Yeah, otherwise, I mean, that, that's just, that's it.
是的，否則，我的意思是，就是這樣，就是這樣。

460
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:24,260
For us hanging out together.
為了我們一起出去玩。

461
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,400
You know, is that what you want?
你知道嗎，這就是你想要的嗎？

462
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:30,260
Can you be civil?
你能文明一點嗎？

463
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:33,220
Yeah.
是的。

464
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:34,840
I can.
我可以。

465
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:35,840
Okay.
好的。

466
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:40,160
Good, all right, let's get back in the car because it's freezing and my chest is unsupported.
好，好吧，我們回到車上吧，因為天氣很冷，我的胸部沒有支撐。

467
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,940
Wait, wait, wait a second.
等等，等等，等一下。

468
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:45,100
I mean, what are we doing?
我的意思是，我們在做什麼？

469
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,260
Who's going with who?
誰和誰一起去？

470
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:53,040
Look, you guys should, you guys should go.
聽著，你們應該，你們應該走。

471
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:57,160
No, um, you know, you planned this all out and...
不，嗯，你知道，這一切都是你計畫好的…

472
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:01,080
I don't want to ruin it, so you guys should just go.
我不想破壞它，所以你們應該走吧。

473
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,500
Come on, man, you drove all the way up here.
來吧，夥計，你一路開車到這裡來的。

474
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:06,140
No, no, no, really, I've got to take the car back anyway.
不不不，真的，無論如何我都要把車開回去。

475
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:08,240
I'm spending all day tomorrow with Ben.
明天我要和本一起度過一整天。

476
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,100
It's fine, okay?
沒關係，好嗎？

477
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:12,340
Just go, no guilt, I promise.
走吧，沒有罪惡感，我保證。

478
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:15,460
Thank you.
謝謝。

479
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:20,200
All right, we'll call you when we get back.
好的，我們回來後打電話給您。

480
00:21:20,420 --> 00:21:20,660
Okay.
好的。

481
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,680
Maybe we could like go to a movie or something.
也許我們可以去看電影什麼的。

482
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:22,980
Okay.
好的。

483
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:23,680
Okay.
好的。

484
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:25,260
Or, or the rodeo!
或者，或者牛仔競技表演！

485
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,020
That'd be great.
那太好了。

486
00:21:28,100 --> 00:21:28,360
Okay.
好的。

487
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:33,000
I was being Shelly Winters from the Poseidon Adventure.
我是海神歷險記中的雪莉溫特斯。

488
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:36,780
I know.
我知道。

489
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,200
Bye!
再見！

490
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:11,400
Ross!
羅斯！

491
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:12,940
Sorry I'm late.
抱歉我來晚了。

492
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,320
Were you sleeping?
你在睡覺嗎？

493
00:22:14,700 --> 00:22:15,660
Uh, no.
呃，不。

494
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:16,680
Oh, great.
哦，太好了。

495
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:21,020
So, uh, I had to get you a whole new battery.
所以，呃，我必須買一塊全新的電池給你。

496
00:22:21,220 --> 00:22:22,500
And I got you the best one I could,
我盡我所能給你最好的，

497
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:23,840
because that's not where you want to skimp.
因為那不是你想省錢的地方。

498
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:25,220
You're a genius, Ross.
你是天才，羅斯。

499
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:27,760
Well, it came to about $112, but what the hell?
好吧，大約是 112 美元，但這到底是什麼？

500
00:22:28,020 --> 00:22:29,180
Just call it an even 110?
就叫偶數110嗎？

501
00:22:30,340 --> 00:22:32,060
Okay, I'll tell you tomorrow, Ross.
好吧，我明天就告訴你，羅斯。

502
00:22:32,060 --> 00:22:32,860
Okay, bye!
好的，再見！

503
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:34,480
So they, uh, they're going to be here tomorrow.
所以他們，呃，他們明天會來這裡。

504
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:35,800
They all took off.
他們都起飛了。

505
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:37,780
It was pretty hard watching them go, you know?
看著他們離開真的很難受，你知道嗎？

506
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:39,940
Yeah, okay, bye.
是的，好的，再見。

507
00:22:44,580 --> 00:22:46,380
So I'm going to take off then.
那我要起飛了。

